    "badge": "Best Portable J1772",
    "amazonUrl": "",
    "pros": [
      "32A Level 2 on a standard NEMA 14-50",
      "J1772 connector suits most non-Tesla EVs",
      "Light enough to keep in the trunk",
      "Stays within limits on 40A or 50A 14-50 circuits",
      "Established EV accessory brand"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Fixed 14-50 plug limits where you can use it",
