          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A portable EV charger is only as good as the outlet behind it. Have a licensed electrician install a dedicated 14-50 or 6-50 with a heavy-duty receptacle and the permit your area requires, respect the 80 percent rule, and buy a listed charger that matches your car's connector.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
